OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,FThe new Police Ombudsman for Northern
OL,8,FIreland has said she is not shocked by
OL,9,Fthe scale of an investigation into a
OL,10,Fformer PSNI officer accused of rape
OL,11,Fand a string of other sex crimes
OL,12,Fallegedly committed while on duty.
OL,14,FUTV first exposed the details of the
OL,15,Finvestigation in January 2026 and
OL,16,Fsince then more women have come
OL,17,Fforward claiming they too were victims.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
