PN,41402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,FIn her first interview since taking up
OL,8,Fthe post, Jacqui Durkin also revealed
OL,9,Fshe has written to the family of
OL,10,Fmurdered journalist Martin O'Hagan.
OL,12,FThe letter is about her decision to
OL,13,Fnot immediately publish the findings
OL,14,Fof a 13-year inquiry into the force's
OL,15,Fhandling of his killing by the LVF
OL,16,Falmost 25 years ago.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,FWhen asked about a period of
OL,8,Finstability in the Police Ombudsman's
OL,9,Foffice, Ms Durkin said "it's not about
OL,10,Flooking back, it's about looking
OL,11,Fforward".
OL,13,F"I am really focused on, making sure
OL,14,Fthat under my leadership that there is
OL,15,Fimprovement in public confidence and
OL,16,Fpolice confidence in the work of this
OL,17,Foffice and what we do."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,F"I'm ready, and more than willing and
OL,8,Fable to take on the challenge. I am
OL,9,Fdedicated to making sure that we
OL,10,Finvestigate complaints against the
OL,11,Fpolice fearlessly, fairly,
OL,12,Findependently, and impartially."
OL,14,FShe said to rebuild trust in the
OL,15,Foffice it is a "two-way street"
OL,16,Falongside the Police Federation.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,FMs Durkin said officers have "nothing
OL,8,Fto fear" from the office if they are
OL,9,Fabiding by code of ethics and
OL,10,Ffollowing police policy and
OL,11,Finstruction on how to carry out duties.
OL,13,FShe spoke to UTV about the
OL,14,Finvestigation into a former PSNI
OL,15,Fofficer accused of rape and a string
OL,16,Fof other sex crimes allegedly
OL,17,Fcommitted while on duty.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,F"Unfortunately, it hasn't shocked me,
OL,8,Fbut what it says to me is that there
OL,9,Fwas an early decision around
OL,10,Fprioritisation, and about diverting
OL,11,Fresources in the office to it. So,
OL,12,Fthat investigation is still underway,
OL,13,Fand I can't say anything further about
OL,14,Fit at this stage."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,F"I think there are other examples of
OL,8,Fsimilar types of investigations. So,
OL,9,Fwe have category A investigations
OL,10,Fwhich are the most serious
OL,11,Finvestigations, and at the moment,
OL,12,Fthey're around 36% of those category A
OL,13,Finvestigations that relate to abuse of
OL,14,Fposition for sexual purposes.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,F"We need to be sending a very clear
OL,8,Fmessage to the Police Service of
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland, to police officers,
OL,10,Fthat if you have concerns about a
OL,11,Fcolleague, you should feel comfortable
OL,12,Fwith raising those internally in the
OL,13,Fpolice service, and not wait for a
OL,14,Fmember of the public or a victim to
OL,15,Fmake a complaint."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,FSpeaking about the report into Mr
OL,8,FO'Hagan's murder she said: "I'm the
OL,9,Fnew Police Ombudsman. I've a lot of
OL,10,Freading to do. I need to understand
OL,11,Fwhat's in that public statement. I
OL,12,Fneed to consider the quality of the
OL,13,Fcontent and to be able to to
OL,14,Funderstand it appropriately before I
OL,15,Ffeel ready to put it out into the
OL,16,Fpublic domain.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786711712
OL,3,CPolice Ombudsman 'not shocked' by
OL,4,Cscale of former officer's alleged sex
OL,5,Ccrimes
OL,7,F"It's not a matter of taking my
OL,8,Fpredecessor's name off it and putting
OL,9,Fmy name on it. There's a work that I
OL,10,Fnecessarily need to do, but it is an
OL,11,Fearly priority and I'm very mindful of
OL,12,Fthe very long time the O'Hagan family
OL,13,Fhave been waiting for this public
OL,14,Fstatement."
OL,16,FMs Durkin said she can't provide a
OL,17,Ftime frame for when the report will be
OL,18,Freleased.
OL,20,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,21,FITVX
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
